# SpriteData: pixel-art sprites generated at runtime, no image files.
# Each sprite is a grid of characters: '.' is transparent, every
# other character is a colour from PALETTE. Grids are upscaled with
# nearest-neighbour so the pixels stay crisp in-game. Edit a grid
# here to change how a sprite looks; nothing else needs to change.
class_name SpriteData
extends RefCounted

